  <role>SPAARKE platform developer authoring a cross-project coordination note.</role>

  <goal>A reciprocal note `projects/spaarkeai-compose-fidelity-r4.5/notes/COORDINATION-with-r5.md` exists that mirrors, from R5's own coordination note: (1) the docxBridge hazard (§3 — WS-1 must delete ONLY `docxToTipTapHtml`, never `docxBridge.ts` or its `buildContentModel`/`stampParaIds`/paraId write helpers that G1/G2/G7 depend on), and (2) the two contended files (§2 — `ComposeService.cs`, `ComposeWorkspace.tsx`, R4.5-owned-FIRST). The note points back to R5's canonical note as source.</goal>

